<Slide style={{
    width: 1280,
    height: 720,
    background: '#FFFFFF',
    padding: '60px 60px',
    flexDirection: 'column',
    fontFamily: '"Arial", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif',
}}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#3D7BD9', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1.6 }}>
        STEP 6 / 7 · RESULTS (2/3) · H2 / H3
    </Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', lineHeight: 1.2, marginTop: 10 }}>
        How far behind — and where the gap is not
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 36, marginTop: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 574 }}>
            <Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 46 }}>B2</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>0.0270</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568' }}>[0.0241, 0.0298]</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 3 }}>
                    best transparent arm — and not the one we pre-registered
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ marginTop: 16 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', width: 46 }}>B4</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>0.0317</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568' }}>[0.0278, 0.0359]</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 3 }}>
                    the pre-registered arm
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ marginTop: 18, padding: '12px 16px', background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 6 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>H3, description only.</span>{' '}
                    Promotion widens the gap (+0.0113); early rounds narrow it (−0.0108) — the opposite of the
                    hypothesised sign. Kept as a description, not as support.
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 540 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#8B97A8', textAlign: 'right', marginBottom: 6 }}>
                three de-vigging methods · 90% cluster CI · 48-block bootstrap
            </Text>
            <Image src="assets/fig07.png" style={{ width: 528, height: 322 }} />
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ padding: '11px 20px', background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            Every transparent arm trails the market, and both headline intervals sit entirely above +0.02 nats.
            Part of B2's lead is the protocol, not the model: it refreshes inside the season while B4 is frozen.
            Freeze both and the order reverses.
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 9 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>DSC5001 · Statistical Machine Learning I</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>Team 32 · 8/10</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
